stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Received: receive
  Received --> Processing: validated
  Processing --> Completed: success
  Processing --> RetryWait: recoverable error
  RetryWait --> Processing: retry permitted
  RetryWait --> Failed: retry budget exceeded
  Processing --> Failed: terminal error
  Completed --> [*]
  Failed --> [*]
